      501.76
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Secton 18 of the Electronic Transactions Act, No. 19 of 2006, I , Ajith P. Perera,Minister of Digital Infrastructure and Information Technology, do by this order, designate the Sri Lanka CompurterEmergency Readiness Team (Sri Lanka CERT) registered as Sri Lanka CERT (Private) Limited under the Companies Act,No. 7 of 2007, as the Certification Authority for the purposes of the said Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      514.69,
      537.82,
      537.76
    ],
    "text": "The Order made under Section 18 and published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1829/29 of September, 24,2013 is hereby rescinded without prejudice to anything done thereunder.",
